A||||3||fierospeeder||Stories of your car/bike/truck breakdowns||||1||
Z||000000||fierospeeder||05-17-2001||01:32 AM||||My car just broke down today.  Im at the redlight just coming back from school and the car cuts out.  I get it to the turning lane, lucky there was one, and An SUV owner, what luck, but he did help me push it into a bar parking lot.  My mom picks me up and brings me home.  At 8pm 4 hours later, i see if i can start the car, thinking it might be the ignition module going out cause of the hot weather.  Well the car starts.  I go get my dad.... Anyway, im driving 4 blocks and it cuts out at another light.  I was lucky there was a side street on a decline where i pushed and sat in the car while it went downhill.  I tried swapping coils, but no luck.  I pulled the schrader valve and no fuel coming out.  My dad comes back(thats another story of how he didn't see me when my car died) we put 3 gallons in.  NO luck.  I went underneath and heard the pump humming.    Got the tow truck and towed it to my house.   Either i have a bad filter, something is clogging in the tank, or my pump is bad.  will know this weekend.<P>Another breakdowns.  My fiero's alt belt breaking on me.  Made it to a parts store substuting a rag for a belt and uh drove without a waterpump the rest of the way home.<P>I had two breakdowns with alternators in my tbird.  One was very far away from home.  Bought a battery at a parts store across the block and it got me home.  2nd was near home, and i swapped several used alternators from the junkyard.  <P>reading this might be hard, i tried to compress it a lot.  <P>I hate having my car die on me, very embarrassing, and you get this hot chicks looking at you.  gee.. Hey there fierolisa.<BR>You always have to have your tools on you.  Seen two guys trying to fix a car in a parking lot about a block away from my cars death.  Sucks,  have to buy my own tow truck.||||reg||1
Z||000001||FieroJoe||05-17-2001||10:53 AM||||Well, uh, I had my bike chain come off the gears once, and then I got tangled and fell down, so that kinda sucked  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>but anyways, no, I have yet to have a car related breakdown, thankfully.  Knock on enduraflex!<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/joesig_1.jpg"> <BR>'87 Coupe 5spd.<BR>AIM:FieroJoe87||||reg||1
Z||000002||loafer87gt||05-17-2001||04:03 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by FieroJoe:<BR><B>Well, uh, I had my bike chain come off the gears once, and then I got tangled and fell down, so that kinda sucked   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>but anyways, no, I have yet to have a car related breakdown, thankfully.  Knock on enduraflex!<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Ouch, I can remember when I was kid barrelling down a hill on my bike and the chain came loose. My feet slipped off the peddles and caught the crossbar right in the groin. I cried like a little girl.<P>||||reg||1
Z||000003||Joe4x4||05-19-2001||02:05 PM||||Stories ....Boy Do I Have Stories.... <P>1).......<P>This could turn out to be a moive!<BR>Let`s start with bikes.....when my parents <BR>got me my first bike my brother put it together ( a Road Runner from the 5&10 )<BR>I made a right out of the driveway down the street 100 yards. I came to the intersection<BR>( I had a stop sign ) DID not stop .<BR>Here comes a car to my left....Crash...<BR>The car skids and I under the front end.<BR>1 1/2 feet the front end,...the lady jumps out ARE YOU OK !!!...I look at my-self ...<BR>I say YUP..<BR>I look at my bike ,my bars are bent my front <BR>wheel bent .<BR>I step on my wheel to make it staight, step on my bars to straighten them out.<P>2)......<BR>Learning to jump <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>After working on my bike.My friends made a ramp..11 inches high.<BR>As I go towards the ramp hit it with FULL <BR>speed.....Looks good ...untill I see  the front the tire come of the forks..( I`m thinking OH SH_T !!!)<BR>CRASH...That hurt .<BR> <BR>3)......<BR>Jumping down a hill with a 4 foot drop<BR>with a girl`s bike.<BR>The jump was good put the landing broke the bike in 2 pieces. Did not get to hurt on that one.<P>4).....<BR>This is one of those things that I still ask <BR>myself ..What was I thinking....<BR>I was riding my 10 speed bike around town,<BR>was playing a game with myself.<BR>Here is the game ...I close my eyes count to 1 open then ,( while I`m riding ).<BR>count to 2 and then open my eyes.<BR>You guys get the Idea.<BR>I got to 10 as I was opening my eyes....CRASH<BR>into a parked car...my butt off the seat ,.<BR>Privates into the shifters...OUCH..THAT  HURT.<P>MORE TO COME.......<P><BR><P>------------------<BR>Need For Speed........<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/car1.gif"> ||||reg||1
